# The Pencil design workspace. Deliberately untracked: it is research material for
# the people working on this repo, not something a consumer needs to clone, and the
# .pen file is a 5.4 MB encrypted binary that git cannot diff — every save would
# rewrite it whole and grow history by its full size. Back it up outside git.
# notes/design-qa.md cites frames in it by id; those references resolve only locally.
pencil/

# Working notes and audit reports. Same reasoning as pencil/: research material for
# whoever is working on the repo, not documentation a consumer needs. Their evidence
# is local anyway — dead /tmp screenshot paths and frame ids in the Pencil canvas —
# so they cannot serve a reader who only has the repo. Decisions that outlive an
# audit belong in docs/, in the code, or in a commit message; the audit itself does
# not. Nothing here is backed up by this repository.
notes/
